#: ../../../how-to/software/remove-an-application.md:0
msgid ""
"Remove applications you no longer use from Ubuntu Desktop with App Center, "
"and learn what happens to dependent applications."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/remove-an-application.md:7
msgid "Topics: Software"
msgstr "話題：軟體"

#: ../../../how-to/software/remove-an-application.md:11
msgid "Remove an application"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/remove-an-application.md:13
msgid ""
"An application is software that has a graphical user interface (GUI). You "
"can use *App Center* to remove applications that you no longer use."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/remove-an-application.md:15
msgid ""
"Applications are available in {ref}`two formats <snap-and-deb-packages>`: "
"snap packages (\"snaps\") and Debian packages (\"debs\"). Some applications "
"are available in both formats. In such a case, the snap will be listed first "
"in App Center."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/remove-an-application.md:18
msgid ""
"You can also use App Center to remove software that doesn't have any GUI."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/remove-an-application.md:21
msgid "To remove an application:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/remove-an-application.md:23
msgid ""
"Click the App Center icon in the Dock, or search for *Software* in the "
"Activities search bar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/remove-an-application.md:25
msgid ""
"When App Center opens, click the {guilabel}`Manage` button in the side bar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/remove-an-application.md:27
msgid ""
"Find the application that you want to remove by looking through the list of "
"installed applications, or by using the search bar."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/remove-an-application.md:29
msgid "Select the application and click {guilabel}`Uninstall`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/remove-an-application.md:31
msgid "Enter your password to confirm that you want to remove the application."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../how-to/software/remove-an-application.md:34
msgid ""
"Some applications depend on other applications to work properly. If you try "
"to remove an application that is needed by another application, both will be "
"removed. App Center will ask you to confirm whether you want this to happen "
"before the applications are removed."
msgstr ""
